# Task 4 - Network Security Threats 
## Objective 

Research and explain common network security threats including:
- Denial of service (DoS/DDoS)
- Man-in-the-Middle (MITM)
- Spoofing attacks 

##Contents 
 This task includes:
- A detailed research report 
- Real-world attack examples 
- Mitiguation strategies 
- Security best practices 

